{"title": "Orthon's Bed", "pageid": 52759, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Orthon's_Bed", "categories": ["Transcripts", "Environmental objects", "Available to Speak with Dead"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Orthon's Bed</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Orthon%27s_Bed.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Orthon's Bed.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Orthon%27s_Bed.png/300px-Orthon%27s_Bed.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Orthon%27s_Bed.png/300px-Orthon%27s_Bed.png.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Orthon%27s_Bed.png/599px-Orthon%27s_Bed.png.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Orthon's Bed.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"167\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure></aside>\nThe <b>Orthon's Bed</b> is special environmental object in the <a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_Shar\" title=\"Gauntlet of Shar\">Gauntlet of Shar</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>. It has the notable distinction of being the only environmental object that <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/20px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/40px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/20px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\">Speak with Dead</a> can be cast on.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>The Orthon's Bed is in the large room where <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yurgir\" title=\"Yurgir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png/25px-Portrait_Yurgir.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png/38px-Portrait_Yurgir.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png/50px-Portrait_Yurgir.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Yurgir\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png/25px-Portrait_Yurgir.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Portrait_Yurgir.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Yurgir\" title=\"Yurgir\">Yurgir</a> and his <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoarding_Merregon\" title=\"Hoarding Merregon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png/25px-Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png/38px-Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png/50px-Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hoarding Merregon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png/25px-Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoarding_Merregon\" title=\"Hoarding Merregon\">Hoarding Merregon</a> lie in wait for an ambush. Whether defeated or pacified, the party can cast Speak with Dead on it to commune with it. Doing so reveals the bed is composed of the dead bodies of Dark Justiciars killed by Yurgir.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Speak_with_Dead\">Speak with Dead</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Orthon%27s_Bed_Speak_with_Dead.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Orthon%27s_Bed_Speak_with_Dead.png/300px-Orthon%27s_Bed_Speak_with_Dead.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Orthon%27s_Bed_Speak_with_Dead.png/450px-Orthon%27s_Bed_Speak_with_Dead.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Orthon%27s_Bed_Speak_with_Dead.png/600px-Orthon%27s_Bed_Speak_with_Dead.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Orthon%27s_Bed_Speak_with_Dead.png/300px-Orthon%27s_Bed_Speak_with_Dead.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"231\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Orthon%27s_Bed_Speak_with_Dead.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Casting Speak with Dead on the bed</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span>Who are you?</span>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Orthon's Bed</dt><dd>Shar's servants. Dark Justiciars.</dd></dl></li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span>What happened to you?</span>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Orthon's Bed</dt><dd>The tusked beast. It attacked. It slaughtered.</dd></dl></li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span>Where are you from?</span>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Orthon's Bed</dt><dd>Everywhere. We came from all corners. To serve.</dd></dl></li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span>What was this place for?</span>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Orthon's Bed</dt><dd>Training. Planning. Worship. The blooding of Shar's warriors.</dd></dl></li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span>What did you do in life?</span>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Orthon's Bed</dt><dd>Served Shar.</dd></dl></li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span>Did anyone survive, or escape the beast?</span>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Orthon's Bed</dt><dd>One. Scattered. Became many.</dd></dl></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714230427\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.095 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.099 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3983/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38240/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15393/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 750/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.026/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1072631/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   91.395      1 -total\n 79.42%   72.590      1 T